    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-1" id="fn-1" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#020202;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:116%">On page 208, line 10, column (b), the Total Plant in Service figure of $213,268,923 includes $399,507 of operating lease right-of-use assets. For the purposes of this page, the right-of-use-assets are excluded, resulting in a total of $212,869,416.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-2" id="fn-2" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#020202;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:116%">On page 208, line 10, column (c),the total In Service Depreciation figure of $177,461,050 includes $75,330 of accumulated depreciation related to operating lease right-of-use assets. For the purposes of this page, the accumulated depreciation related to the right-of-use-assets are excluded resulting in a total of $177,385,720.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
